  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Loss of kinetic energy of the lead bullet<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>Heat generated to raise its temperature from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>127</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>327</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;loss&nbsp;of the kinetic energy of the lead bullet<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>Heat gained by the lead bullet to raise its temperature.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Pb</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>Pb</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Pb</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>Pb</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>125</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>327</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>127</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><ma